{{wikipedia}}
==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[elative]] [[case]]}}

# {{context|grammar|lang=en}} The [[case]] used to indicate movement '''out of''' something; for example, ''out of the house''. Some languages that make use of the elative are [[Finnish]], [[Hungarian]], and [[Estonian]].

